---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Forms from '../components/Forms.astro';
import Close from '../components/Close.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Home" description="Couples, stepfamily and individual counselling with Rachel Glover, RCC. In-person in Victoria, BC and virtual across BC. Book a free 15-minute consultation.">

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="b1-hero">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Rachel Glover, RCC · Victoria, BC</p>
        <h1 class="b-h1"><span class="mask"><span style="--d:.25s">Relationships take work.</span></span><span class="mask acc"><span style="--d:.45s">But most of us were never taught how.</span></span></h1>
        <div class="stack rise" style="--d:.8s">
          <p class="lede">Relationships are an important part of our lives, and they can also come with significant challenges. Whether it’s with a spouse, within a stepfamily, or in other key relationships, sometimes we keep having the same problems despite our best efforts to fix them.</p>
          <p class="lede">My role is to help you understand what’s happening, see things from a different perspective and learn better ways to handle the relationships that matter to you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rise" style="--d:.95s;display:flex;gap:14px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
          <a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free 15-minute consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a>
          <span class="where-line">In-person in Victoria · Virtual across BC</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Forms kind="two" class="b1-forms" />
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Couples: the primary service, given the most weight -->
  <section class="band alt">
    <div class="wrap svc lead">
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">Couples counselling</p>
        <h2 class="b-h1">Communicate better. Feel closer. <span class="acc">Grow together.</span></h2>
        <Forms kind="two" class="svc-forms" />
      </div>
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="body">You may find yourselves having the same arguments, responding poorly or avoiding certain conversations altogether.</p>
        <p class="body">Every couple wants to feel close, and every couple inevitably has differences that can create conflict. It doesn’t have to be one or the other.</p>
        <p class="body">We’ll look at the patterns you’ve fallen into, help you understand each other better, and learn practical ways to communicate and work through problems as a team.</p>
        <div><a class="btn" href="/couples">Learn about couples counselling <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stepfamily: second focus -->
  <section class="band dark">
    <div class="wrap svc">
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">Stepparent &amp; stepfamily support</p>
        <h2 class="b-h1">Stepfamily life is <span class="soft">complex.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="body">Being a stepparent can bring challenges you weren’t expecting: finding your place in the family, different parenting styles, boundaries with the ex-partner or sometimes feeling like an outsider in your own home.</p>
        <p class="body">You may also find yourself trying too hard to make everything work, longing for closer relationships and simplicity, or struggling to overcome difficult feelings.</p>
        <p class="body">I will help you understand why it feels so hard and give you a road map that research shows best supports stepfamilies in building a more cohesive and connected family life.</p>
        <div><a class="btn ghost" href="/stepfamilies">Learn about stepparent &amp; stepfamily support <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Individual: lighter weight -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap svc minor">
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">Individual counselling</p>
        <h2 class="b-h1">Change starts with you.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="body"><span class="strong">Sometimes the only person you can change is yourself.</span> I work with adults who want to better understand themselves and the relationships in their lives. You may be dealing with relationship difficulties, family dynamics, boundaries, a major life change, or patterns you keep finding yourself in.</p>
        <p class="body">We’ll get clear about what’s happening, look at what is and isn’t within your control, and work on changes that can make a meaningful difference in your life and relationships.</p>
        <div><a class="textlink" href="/individuals">Learn about individual counselling</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="b1-about">
    <div class="photo slide-up"><img src="/img/rachel-chair.jpg" alt="Rachel Glover, RCC, seated in an armchair in her office" style="object-position:50% 8%" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
    <div class="txt reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet Rachel</p>
      <h2 class="b-h1">Hi, I’m Rachel.</h2>
      <p class="body">I’m a Registered Clinical Counsellor (RCC) based in Victoria, BC, with a passion for working with couples, relationships and stepfamily dynamics.</p>
      <p class="body">As a wife, mother, stepmother and someone who deeply values strong friendships, I understand that relationships and family life take ongoing work, patience and a willingness to keep learning.</p>
      <div><a class="btn ghost light" href="/about">More about Rachel <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap split2">
      <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">How I work</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">Warm, direct and <span class="acc">actively engaged.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="reveal stack">
        <p class="body">I take a warm yet direct approach to counselling. I am actively engaged in our sessions, asking thought-provoking questions, pointing out patterns and behaviours I notice, and bringing honesty with compassion about what I see.</p>
        <p class="body">We’ll get clear about what you want to change and keep our sessions focused on those goals.</p>
        <p class="pull">I want you to leave counselling feeling relieved, equipped with new knowledge and hopeful about what can change.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Close />
</Base>
